<p class="build-alt">Or build something from scratch</p>

<div class="build-alt-row">
  {% comment %}
    The href names the production editor, which is what a visitor with no JS
    needs; src/build-with-claude.ts repoints it at the editor this build
    targets.
  {% endcomment %}
  <a
    id="build-it-here"
    class="build-alt-cta"
    href="https://editor.archival.dev/new?scratch=1"
    data-umami-event="build-it-here"
  >
    <svg
      class="build-alt-mark"
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
      viewBox="0 0 24 24"
      fill="none"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="1.6"
      stroke-linecap="round"
      stroke-linejoin="round"
      aria-hidden="true"
    >
      <path d="M12 2.6 13.85 9.15 20.4 11 13.85 12.85 12 19.4 10.15 12.85 3.6 11 10.15 9.15z" />
    </svg>
    Build it here
  </a>

  <button id="bwc-launch" type="button" class="build-alt-cta" data-umami-event="bwc-open-modal">
    <svg
      class="build-alt-mark"
      data-cds="Spark"
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
      viewBox="0 0 100 100"
      fill="var(--cds-clay, #d97757)"
      aria-hidden="true"
    >
      <path
        d="m19.6 66.5 19.7-11 .3-1-.3-.5h-1l-3.3-.2-11.2-.3L14 53l-9.5-.5-2.4-.5L0 49l.2-1.5 2-1.3 2.9.2 6.3.5 9.5.6 6.9.4L38 49.1h1.6l.2-.7-.5-.4-.4-.4L29 41l-10.6-7-5.6-4.1-3-2-1.5-2-.6-4.2 2.7-3 3.7.3.9.2 3.7 2.9 8 6.1L37 36l1.5 1.2.6-.4.1-.3-.7-1.1L33 25l-6-10.4-2.7-4.3-.7-2.6c-.3-1-.4-2-.4-3l3-4.2L28 0l4.2.6L33.8 2l2.6 6 4.1 9.3L47 29.9l2 3.8 1 3.4.3 1h.7v-.5l.5-7.2 1-8.7 1-11.2.3-3.2 1.6-3.8 3-2L61 2.6l2 2.9-.3 1.8-1.1 7.7L59 27.1l-1.5 8.2h.9l1-1.1 4.1-5.4 6.9-8.6 3-3.5L77 13l2.3-1.8h4.3l3.1 4.7-1.4 4.9-4.4 5.6-3.7 4.7-5.3 7.1-3.2 5.7.3.4h.7l12-2.6 6.4-1.1 7.6-1.3 3.5 1.6.4 1.6-1.4 3.4-8.2 2-9.6 2-14.3 3.3-.2.1.2.3 6.4.6 2.8.2h6.8l12.6 1 3.3 2 1.9 2.7-.3 2-5.1 2.6-6.8-1.6-16-3.8-5.4-1.3h-.8v.4l4.6 4.5 8.3 7.5L89 80.1l.5 2.4-1.3 2-1.4-.2-9.2-7-3.6-3-8-6.8h-.5v.7l1.8 2.7 9.8 14.7.5 4.5-.7 1.4-2.6 1-2.7-.6-5.8-8-6-9-4.7-8.2-.5.4-2.9 30.2-1.3 1.5-3 1.2-2.5-2-1.4-3 1.4-6.2 1.6-8 1.3-6.4 1.2-7.9.7-2.6v-.2H49L43 72l-9 12.3-7.2 7.6-1.7.7-3-1.5.3-2.8L24 86l10-12.8 6-7.9 4-4.6-.1-.5h-.3L17.2 77.4l-4.7.6-2-2 .2-3 1-1 8-5.5Z"
      ></path>
    </svg>
    Build it with Claude
  </button>
</div>

{% comment %}
  The connector has to be in place before Claude opens - one added partway
  through a conversation does not appear in it - so the deep link waits behind
  its own button rather than firing when this dialog opens. The session is minted
  by that button too: leaving to set up a connector should not spend one.
{% endcomment %}
<dialog id="bwc-modal" class="bwc-modal">
  <button id="bwc-close" type="button" class="bwc-close" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>

  <h2 class="bwc-modal-title">Two steps and you're building</h2>

  <ol class="bwc-steps">
    <li id="bwc-step-connector" class="bwc-step">
      <p class="bwc-step-title">Add the Archival connector</p>
      <p class="bwc-note">
        Once, for your Claude account — it's how Claude builds and publishes your site. The link fills in the name and
        URL for you.
      </p>
      <p class="bwc-note bwc-permission">
        When it asks about tool permissions, choose
        <img
          class="bwc-permission-shot"
          src="/img/claude-always-allow.png"
          alt="Always allow"
          width="149"
          height="28"
        />
      </p>
      <div class="bwc-button-cols">
        <a
          id="bwc-connector"
          class="bwc-connector"
          href="https://claude.ai/customize/connectors?modal=add-custom-connector&amp;connectorName=Archival&amp;connectorUrl=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.archival.dev%2Fmcp"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          data-umami-event="bwc-add-connector"
          >Add the connector</a
        >
        <div class="bwc-check">
          <div class="switch">
            <input id="bwc-connector-done" type="checkbox" />
            <div class="slider round"></div>
          </div>
          <label for="bwc-connector-done">I've already got it</label>
        </div>
      </div>
    </li>

    <li class="bwc-step">
      <p class="bwc-step-title">Open Claude</p>
      <p class="bwc-note">We'll reserve a preview for you and hand Claude a prompt that carries everything it needs.</p>
      <div class="bwc-button-cols">
        <button id="bwc-open" type="button" class="bwc-open" data-umami-event="bwc-deeplink">
          <span id="bwc-open-label">Open Claude App</span>
        </button>
        <a
          id="bwc-cloud"
          class="bwc-cloud"
          href="https://claude.ai/new"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          data-umami-event="bwc-cloud-session"
          >Open Claude in your browser</a
        >
      </div>
      <div id="bwc-turnstile" class="bwc-turnstile"></div>
      <p id="bwc-error" class="bwc-error" hidden></p>
    </li>
  </ol>

  <div id="bwc-launched" class="bwc-launched" hidden>
    <p class="bwc-note">
      If you have the Claude app installed, this button will open it. If not, you can open it in your browser or click
      "Copy Prompt" and paste into a Claude chat.
    </p>
    <p class="bwc-note">
      Your preview code is <code id="bwc-name" class="bwc-code"></code>, and it will work for the next two hours.
    </p>

    <div class="bwc-copy-row">
      <button id="bwc-copy" type="button" class="bwc-copy" data-umami-event="bwc-copy-command">
        {% comment %} Swapped for the check by .copied on the button. {% endcomment %}
        <svg
          class="bwc-copy-icon"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          width="18"
          height="18"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" />
          <path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1" />
        </svg>
        <svg
          class="bwc-copy-check"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          width="18"
          height="18"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" />
        </svg>
        <span id="bwc-copy-label" class="bwc-copy-label">Copy prompt</span>
      </button>
    </div>

    {% comment %} Announced rather than only shown, since the icon change is visual. {% endcomment %}
    <p id="bwc-copy-status" class="bwc-copy-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </div>
</dialog>

<script
  src="https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/api.js?onload=onloadTurnstileCallback&render=explicit"
  async
  defer
></script>
<script type="module" src="/scripts/build-with-claude.js"></script>
